# Allowlist, not a denylist (spec 005 RF-5, RNF-3, plan-D5): exclude everything
# and readmit only what `pip install .` needs. Any new file (another .env, a
# credentials.json, local notes...) stays out of the build context by default,
# without anyone having to remember to add it here.
*

!pyproject.toml
!requirements.lock
!requirements-build.lock
!app/

# Readmitting app/ also readmits local bytecode: keep it out.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
